{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22400","headline":"自觉二首 一 · 白居易","name":"自觉二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四十未爲老，忧伤早衰恶。\n前岁二毛生，今年一齿落。\n形骸日损耗，心事同萧索。\n夜寝与朝餐，其间味亦薄。\n同岁崔舍人，容光方灼灼。\n始知年与貌，衰盛随忧乐。\n畏老老转迫，忧病病弥缚。\n不畏复不忧，是除老病药。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22400.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22400","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}